            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# RunHuddle 0.13.2

- Checking agent connections from Getting started now opens a sheet over the guide. Closing Connections returns to the same guide step.
- Sidebar Connections and notification actions now use visible button styling and icons. Connection status and the version number remain informational text.

Validation: native build, full release tests, standalone packaging and updater checks. Live window interaction is not automatically tested.
]]></description>
